WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Susa utshani nokhula endaweni eyindilinga lapho isihlahla sizokhula khona.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Yimba umgodi obanzi, ujule njengesigaxa sezimpande. Hlukanisa umhlabathi ongaphezulu.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Gcwalisa umgodi ngamanzi. Uma amanzi esekhona ngakusasa, tshala endundumeni.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Linganisa ingaphezulu lesigaxa sezimpande nomhlabathi. Indawo yokuxhumela mayibe ngaphezu komhlabathi.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Cindezela umhlabathi kancane. Yenza isitsha samanzi, ugcine i-mulch ikude nesiqu.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Nisela ujule ukuze amanzi afinyelele ezimpandeni zesihlahla esisha.
